## Executive Summary

Muse Wonder Full is Meta's highest-capability general-purpose model from the Muse Wonder series, released in 2026, designed for complex, long-running professional workflows across coding, legal, finance, and health. It features multimodal input (text, image, video, audio), strong performance across agentic benchmarks, and competitive pricing. The model ranks 32nd overall with a score of 89.0/100, indicating strong performance in the frontier model landscape. Muse Wonder Full is available exclusively through Muse Code subscription, making it a premium offering compared to the general Muse Wonder model.

